# A spent extractor, refreshed, works again - and is spent again by the working.
#
# **The evidence is the food and not the column.** `CLAUDE.md`: *a check whose subject is behaviour
# reads the outcome, not the input* - a test asserting only that `working` went from 0 to 1 would
# be satisfied by a rule that writes the column and changes nothing about what the extractor can
# do.
#
# **The `then` says `working:0` again** because `work` spends what `refresh-working` restored,
# which is the whole loop in one file.

{test name:refresh-restores-a-spent-extractor}

{given}
{territory id:1 name:territory-1}
{deposit where:territory-1 what:food density:6} -> 1
{extractor where:territory-1 what:food working:0} -> 1
{labor where:territory-1} -> 1

{when}
{refresh-working where:territory-1}
{work where:territory-1 what:food}

{then}
{territory id:1 name:territory-1}
{deposit where:territory-1 what:food density:6} -> 1
{extractor where:territory-1 what:food working:0} -> 1
{food where:territory-1} -> 6
